# Mutation plan for plugin slash commands under the Rust host (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6):
# the registry, execution through POST /api/v4/commands/execute, HandleCommandResponse, the
# command half of the plugin API and the autocomplete list's plugin half.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-commands.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::plugin_slash_commands_run_as_go_runs_them`: a Go host and a
# Rust host each run nineteen commands and a command script, and every answer, hook, frame, post
# and the autocomplete list and suggestions are compared. Two lines are unit mutations of the
# registry. The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

